                # MAE/MFE FIX: the single most important missing diagnostic -- without these,
                # a losing trade's cause (bad entry vs. bad exit/management) is unknowable from
                # entry/exit price alone. mfe_pct = best the trade ever moved in our favor before
                # exit; mae_pct = worst it ever moved against us before exit. A trade with high
